# Environment for the writer profile.
# Copy to `.env` and fill in. The model (provider `nous`) authenticates via
# `hermes auth` / portal OAuth, NOT via keys here — nothing is required for
# the profile to install. Parallel Search MCP is anonymous (no key).

# Optional: higher Parallel Search rate limits (key from platform.parallel.ai).
# Uncomment to use an authenticated endpoint instead of the anonymous default
# by editing mcp_servers.parallel-search in this profile's config.yaml.
# PARALLEL_API_KEY=
